# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This project deploys to Linux containers and Linux-based runtimes, where a
# stray CRLF in a shell script or a Dockerfile can break a build in ways that
# are hard to see. Forcing LF everywhere removes that class of problem.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish files that must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
